cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Isabella V6 / TINA / Genesis or the GAME OVER (UAGP-1) module, please cite this work."
title: "Isabella V6 — TINA — Genesis: Cognitive Governance Runtime and Universal Agent Governance Protocol (UAGP-1)"
abstract: >-
  Isabella V6 / TINA / Genesis is a governed, sovereign and auditable cognitive
  runtime. It separates capability, authority, execution, evidence, learning and
  production. GAME OVER (Universal Agent Governance Protocol, UAGP-1) is the
  agent-governance meta-layer that validates AI Passport identity, trust, risk,
  ethics, human approval and audit before a build or deploy. Identifiers:
  ORCID 0009-0008-5050-1539; ISNI 0000 0005 3169 9229.
